{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>A continual fire.</b> The fire concerning which 'continual' is stated — it is that with which they kindle the lamps, concerning which it is said ״לְהַעֲלֹת נֵר תָּמִיד״ (Exodus 27); and with it as well the outer altar is burned upon (Yoma 45)." "<b>It shall not go out.</b> One who extinguishes fire upon the altar transgresses two negative commandments."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:09.527822279Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}